# Verification Gates

## Progress (`.ai/PROGRESS.md`)

AI may **propose** only: Implementation, Tests, Documentation (project track).

AI must **never** mark complete: Understanding, Architecture, Interview, knowledge scores, No-AI Learned.

User must explicitly verify. Code complete ≠ knowledge complete.

## Review (`.ai/REVIEW_PROTOCOL.md`)

Classify findings: CRITICAL / MAJOR / MINOR / COSMETIC.

- CRITICAL/MAJOR/MINOR → user fixes (report problems; do not auto-fix all).
- COSMETIC → AI may fix.
- CRITICAL or MAJOR open → **cannot SHIP**.

## After major work

1. No-AI gate (explain / rebuild / debug / redesign). Fail → `LEARNING REQUIRED`.
2. Engineering Score template in `.ai/PROGRESS.md`.
3. Decision/journal via `.ai/DECISION_LOG.md` + `docs/journal/`.

Paths: `.ai/PROGRESS.md`, `.ai/BACKLOG.md`, `.ai/DECISION_LOG.md`.
